[by: LRCLIB contributors (timing) and Anime Songs Lyrics (lyrics)]
[00:11.58] Yuuyake sore ga someru machi to kimi no yokogao
[00:22.88] Nani wo omoi, nani wo mitsume, nani wo kanjite iru no?
[00:34.05] Tatoeba sono saki ni boku-tachi no asu ga mienai nara
[00:43.74] Boku wa kimi no te wo nigiri, doko made mo kakete yuku yo
[00:58.59] Egao to yume to itoshisa to yorokobi wo torimodoshite
[01:06.75] Ima de mo osokunai
[01:09.61] Katachi aru mono, sore dake ga koko ni iru subete nante
[01:19.39] Dare mo semenai kara
[01:24.35] Yuugure toki wa aseru kokoro wasuresaseteku
[01:35.52] Isogashii nagare wo kitte shashin ni shita you de
[01:46.62] Kono basho ga suki da to hanashiteta kimi no hoho wo tsutau akai namida
[02:00.04] Mou nido to, aenai yokan ga shiteta
[02:10.88] Namida mo uso mo kanashimi mo koukai mo, subete kimi to koko ni ita akashi da yo
[02:22.14] Wakare wa futari dake ga shiru omoide no hajimari da to
