[02:35.54] Mata itsuka...
[02:56.04] Sasayaku koe ga kono mama tooku natte
[03:01.29] Kimi no kage mo yuuhi ni nomareteku
[03:06.79] Muda ni sugiyuku toki nante nai n da to iikikasete...
[03:17.85] Egao mo yume mo itoshisa mo yorokobi mo yobiokoshite
[03:26.34] Towa ni hibikitsuzukeru
[03:28.91] Katachi aru mono, sore dake ga koko ni iru subete nante
